-
-- Protocol buffers for serialization
-- Core sync logic
-
-#### 8. **plugins-service** (`packages/plugins-service/`)
-
-Service for handling plugins/extensions.
-
-#### 9. **eslint-plugin-actual** (`packages/eslint-plugin-actual/`)
-
