Subject: [PATCH 6/8] [AI] Keep search, sort and filters when toggling
 reconciled transactions

Toggling reconciled rebuilt the query from the root, which dropped the
active search (and could drop the sort when no filters were set). The root
query doesn't depend on showReconciled, so re-run the current query instead.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
