From 7bc4e04a7512bd547e8a3c6b2a297a8105699d8c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Context Ops Demo <demo@example.invalid>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 21:37:14 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 7/8] [AI] Add a Quarterly interval to custom reports

Quarters are keyed by their first month (Q3 2026 is 2026-07) and labelled
Q3 '26. They are queried by month and rolled up client-side, like weeks are
rolled up from days, so there are no AQL changes. Budgeted reports sum the
monthly budgeted amounts into the quarter.

Out of range From/To picks fall back to four whole quarters. NetWorth,
BalanceForecast and Spending are unchanged.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
