From 8cece049fa39354313e70b8719c958b5d16755d8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Context Ops Demo <demo@example.invalid>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 21:39:58 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 8/8] [AI] Fix custom report range flipping for a To in the
 same period as From

validateEnd compared the stored From date (a full date) with the raw To
pick (a bare month or year key). As strings the longer one sorts later, so
a To in the same month, quarter or year looked reversed and From was reset
to the fallback range. Compare against the normalized end date instead, and
add tests for the same month, quarter and year.

Also use satisfies for the category fixtures in the quarterly fetch tests and
explain the remaining mock cast.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
